			dependencies: ["5CFB446EC47CB53D"]
			description: [
				"&6Armour made from dark matter are extremely durable to the point of reaching infinity, and boasting substantial defence that differs in nature compared to other armours, absorbing damage directly. Due to being so dense and generalized, it lacks the specific attributes that other armour sets may boast as advantages such as mana capacity and generation and special abilities."
