		{
			dependencies: ["4E62B2BDC912CCA1"]
			description: [
				"&8“The Windswept Hollow is a barren wasteland of Void Ash containing ancient ruins and covered fossils. It’s host to a variety of valuable resources and is one of the only places where you could find Sulfur.\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&8“但这些宝藏并非无人看管。我建议你小心脚下，因为灰烬中潜伏着多种伏击掠食者。然而，该生物群系的真正价值在于其地表之下。灰沙丘下是荒芜洞穴，里面充满了能让稀有矿物生长的病态土壤。”"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "1D1398D93B1EED36"
