		{
			dependencies: ["152DC73801813764"]
			description: [
				"&8\"After digging through the undergrowth of the infection for a while, we happened upon a strange opening. The Watcher Chamber, as I have dubbed it, is home to the &6Hive's Watcher. &8It seems to be connected to all of the eyes within the fleshy biome, and the moment we stepped foot within its area, it attacked us.\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&b\"它主要靠冲向我们和到处喷吐脓液来攻击。在防守了一段时间后，我发现当我们在对角线位置时，它无法直接朝我们移动，这让我们能干净利落地击败它。\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&8“击败它后，我们收集到了一些Ambrosial Flesh Chunks，这恰好是我们完全掌控感染之力所需的最后几种材料。”"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "the_deep_void:eye_of_the_hive_watcher"
			id: "19BCED907816DC38"
